      {
        "label": "ASML (NASDAQ ADR) down ~5.08% on 7/7 (Samsung Q2 miss -> chip-equip selloff); price approximated from daily-move recap x library 7/6 close 1825.07 (~$1732, sources cite -3.6% EUR / -4.6% intraday / -5.08% full day). Market cap price-scaled from library 715.48bn/1825.07. Exact USD close not cleanly published as of 7/8",
