        "data_status": "estimate"
      },
      {
        "label": "net_debt=-6.52 bn｜口径:net_debt = 有息债务 −(现金及等价物 + 短期投资)。分量(€bn,截至 2026-03-29):有息债务(长期债务/债券)2.7056;现金及等价物 7.9704;短期投资 0.4059;现金+短投合计 8.3763。EUR 净现金 = 2.7056 − 8.3763 = -5.6707。按期末汇率换算:-5.6707 × 1.149425 = -6.52 USD bn(净现金)。租赁排除见 lease_excluded_note。二手印证:cash €7,970.4M / ST inv €405.9M / LT debt €2,705.6M 经 SEC 6-K 摘要、asml.com/nasdaq 新闻稿、YCharts『Total Long-Term Debt』等多来源一致。已用 SEC 原文与本地 Dayu filing fil_0001628280-26-025147 复核。",
        "url": "https://www.asml.com/en/news/press-releases/2026/q1-2026-financial-results",
        "data_status": "official"
      }
